# Copy to courier.env (gitignored) and fill in. The wrapper auto-loads it
# (shared couriers/courier.env first, then this package's courier.env).
#
# Where the standalone Mon Hopecore Agent engine checkout lives. The wrapper
# execs its factory/ scripts and reads its bank / ledgers / scoreboard for
# status. Only set this if the engine lives somewhere non-default.
# Default: /Users/ericcromartie/Documents/Development/Mon Hopecore Agent
#OCEAN_HOPECORE_ENGINE_DIR=/Users/ericcromartie/Documents/Development/Mon Hopecore Agent

# No tokens belong in this package. The engine resolves its own keys at
# runtime: XAI_API_KEY (Grok miner/OCR, via 1Password in grok_client.py),
# GEMINI_API_KEY (moment finder; model override HOPECORE_GEMINI_MODEL), and
# the Slack bot token + SLACK_CHANNEL from the engine's repo-root .env.
